=== 2022 Quarter 3 Update (26/10/2022) ===
'''King Level Rework + Champions Unlock'''

* {{Balance|Buff}} [[Experience|King Level]] now go up to Level 50.
* The Level-up [[Chests]] are smaller, but you get more (50 compared to 14).
* {{Balance|Neutral}} The [[:Category:Tower Troop Cards|Crown Tower]] Level will still be capped at Level 14.
* {{Balance|Buff}} You now unlock {{Rarity|Champion|}} [[Cards]] from [[Arenas]] and their [[Chests]].

'''Trophy Road'''

* {{Balance|Add}} In [[Trophies|Trophy]] Road, there are 6 new [[Arenas]] (up to Arena 20 at 7,500 trophies). These arenas are: Miner's Mine, Executioner's Kitchen, Royal Crypt, Silent Sanctuary, & Dragon Spa.
* {{Balance|Add}} Besides the Trophy requirement, there is also going to be a King Level requirement.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} It will not reset, and you can't go higher than 7,500 Trophies.

'''Path of Legends'''

* {{Balance|Add}} You can now switch in between Trophy Road & [[Ranked|Path of Legends]].
* Path of Legends unlocks at [[Arenas|Arena 15]] (5,000 trophies).
* There are 10 Leagues, each having a Level cap.
* Every time you win, you go up a step. Every time you lose, you go down a step.
* There are golden steps, where you can't drop down (like a checkpoint). The higher the League, the less golden steps.
* After Ultimate Champion, there are no steps. Instead, there are player ratings.
* You will be reset to Challenger 1 after the Season ends. However, the higher League you were before the reset, the higher the step multiplier at the next season.

'''Daily Tasks'''

* {{Balance|Add}} Each day, you have 3 tasks. You get a small reward from completing each.
* You can get a daily bonus if you complete all 3 tasks.
* Doing it 7 days in a row unlocks you a weekly bonus.

'''New Cards'''

* {{Balance|Add}} 1 New {{Rarity|Legendary}} card: [[Phoenix]].
* {{Balance|Add}} 1 New {{Rarity|Champion}} card: [[Monk]].

'''Hoggy Bank'''

* {{Balance|Add}} Hoggy Bank is a new premium feature that will cost money to unlock. It will appear on the home screen from time to time and will hold either [[Gems]] or [[Gold]].
* After purchasing the Hoggy Bank, the bank will enable you to receive additional Gold or Gems (depending on the type that you have purchased) that will be stored in the Hoggy Bank.
* Additionally, during the time period that the Hoggy Bank is active, there will be additional milestones that you can complete and then be able to smash the bank to empty the bank and reap the reward!

'''Card Balancing'''

* {{Balance|Buff}} [[Knight]]: Hitpoints increased by 3%.
