**{{Balance|Buff}} Count increased to 4 (from 3)
**{{Balance|Nerf}} (affects [[Goblin Gang]], [[Goblin Barrel]], [[Goblin Drill]]) First Attack Period increased to 0.4 seconds (from 0.2 seconds).
* {{Balance|Remove}} [[Mirror]]: Greyed out (not playable) after playing a {{Rarity|Champion}} (from skipping the {{Rarity|Champion}}).

