=== Summer 2022 Update (27/6/2022) ===
'''[[Battle Banners]]'''

* Banners are something you can design.
* {{Balance|Add}} The Banner has 3 elements:
** Frame (background).
** Decoration (foreground).
** [[Player Profile|Badges]] (up to 3 can be selected).
* The Banners can appear in your profile & in [[Basics of Battle|battle]] before it starts.
* {{Balance|Add}} You can unlock Banner parts in the Banner Box.
** The Banner Box can be accessed directly from the home screen.
** The Banner Box cost 100 Banner Tokens or [[Gems]] (starts at 50 & goes up by 50 with each Gem purchase, price resets after every season) & gives 1 Banner element.

'''Profile Redesign'''

* {{Balance|Add}} Your Battle Banner is visible and can be tapped to access your Player Profile.
* You can enter your Battle Log (only on your own profile).
* You can chose up to 8 badges to show. If you want to see them all, click on "Show Collection".
* Battle Deck now shows the latest [[Battle Decks|deck]] played by the player.
* The rest (League, Stats and Challenge Stats) are the same as normal.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} The Pass Royale Banner has been moved and resized.

'''New Badges'''

* {{Balance|Add}} Win [[Clan Wars|Clan War]] matches. 8 upgrades (10, 25, 50, 100, 250, 500, 1000, 2500).
* {{Balance|Add}} [[Clans|Donate]] [[cards]]. Progress depend on rarity ({{Rarity|Common}} = 1 card, {{Rarity|Rare}} & {{Rarity|Epic}}= 10 cards). 8 upgrades (100, 500, 1000, 5000, 10000, 25000, 50000, 100000).
* {{Balance|Add}} Collect/upgrade cards. The progress is the sum of all of the cards' Levels. 8 upgrades (100, 200, 400, 600, 800, 1000, 1200).
* {{Balance|Add}} Collect Battle Banner Items. 8 upgrades (15, 30, 50, 100, 150, 200, 300, 400).
* {{Balance|Add}} Win [[2v2|2v2 battles]]. 7 upgrades (10, 25, 50, 100, 200, 500, 1000).
* {{Balance|Add}} Collect [[Emotes]]. 8 upgrades (0, 25, 50, 100, 150, 200, 250, 300).
* {{Balance|Add}} Be a Supercell Creator.
* {{Balance|Add}} Watch the credits to the end.

'''Other Changes'''

* {{Balance|Add}} 10 cards are getting 3 more levels in the [[Card Mastery]] feature. The rewards are: 100, 125 and 150 Banner Tokens.
** The 10 cards are: [[Arrows]], [[Earthquake]], [[Electro Spirit]], [[Mega Knight]], [[Mortar]], [[P.E.K.K.A.|P.E.K.K.A]], [[Princess]], [[The Log]], [[Wall Breakers]], [[Wizard]].
* {{Balance|Add}} You can play duels outside of Clan Wars. The duel deck slots are accessible via a toggle button at your deck slot panel.
* There are 2 modes for this:
** Duel: Best of 3, where you chose a deck before each round. You can not play the same deck 2 times
** Ban Pick Duel: Best of 1, where you can first see the opponent's 4 decks & ban 2 of their decks. Then, you have to choose 1 of your remaining 2 decks to play.
* {{Balance|Add}} There is a slider for music and sound effects.
* {{Balance|Neutral}} The [[Trade Tokens|Trader]] has been moved to the [[Shop]]. You can also reroll both "Give" and "Get" and trade as many times as you want (given you have enough Trade Tokens/rerolls).

